    {
      "refdes": "U1",
      "kind": "Custom",
      "value": "INA180A2",
      "pos": [
        44,
        14
      ],
      "rot": 0,
      "footprint": "SOT-23-5_P0.95",
      "custom": {
        "name": "INA180A2",
        "prefix": "U",
        "pins": [
          {
            "number": "3",
            "name": "IN+",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "number": "4",
            "name": "IN-",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "number": "5",
            "name": "V+",
            "side": "top"
          },
          {
            "number": "2",
            "name": "GND",
            "side": "bottom"
          },
          {
            "number": "1",
            "name": "OUT",
            "side": "right"
          }
        ],
        "sim": {
          "kind": "subckt",
          "element": "",
          "name": "INA180A2",
          "text": ".subckt INA180A2 inp inn vp gnd out\n* gain 50; the output cannot go below ~5 mV or above V+ - 0.2 V\nBo o gnd V=limit(50*V(inp,inn),0.005,V(vp,gnd)-0.2)*step(V(vp,gnd)-2.6,0.2)\nRiq vp gnd 12k\nRo o out 5\n.ends INA180A2",
          "pins": [
            "3",
            "4",
            "5",
            "2",
            "1"
          ],
          "params": {},
          "limits": [
            "入力オフセット(±150µV)・入力バイアス電流・同相除去比・帯域(350kHz)は扱いません。小さな電流(出力が約5mV 以下)では実物と同様に 0 付近で頭打ちになります。",
            "片方向のアンプです。IN- が IN+ より高い(逆向きの電流)と、出力は 0 付近のままです。",
            "シャント抵抗は別に置いてください(例: 10mΩ に 3A で 30mV → 1.5V)。"
          ]
        },
        "ratings": {
          "v_max": 26.0,
          "rows": [
            {
              "name": "ゲイン",
              "value": "50V/V"
            },
            {
              "name": "同相電圧範囲",
              "value": "-0.2〜26V"
            },
            {
              "name": "電源電圧",
              "value": "2.7〜5.5V"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "refdes": "U2",
      "kind": "Custom",
      "value": "ACS712-05B",
      "pos": [
        74,
        14
      ],
      "rot": 0,
      "footprint": "SOIC-8_ACS712",
      "custom": {
        "name": "ACS712-05B",
        "prefix": "U",
        "pins": [
          {
            "number": "1",
            "name": "IP+",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "number": "3",
            "name": "IP-",
            "side": "left"
          },
          {
            "number": "5",
            "name": "GND",
            "side": "bottom"
          },
          {
            "number": "6",
            "name": "FILTER",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "number": "7",
            "name": "VIOUT",
            "side": "right"
          },
          {
            "number": "8",
            "name": "VCC",
            "side": "top"
          }
        ],
        "sim": {
          "kind": "subckt",
          "element": "",
          "name": "ACS712",
          "text": ".subckt ACS712 ipp ipn gnd filt out vcc\n* primary conductor 1.2 mohm; current into IP+ and out of IP- is positive\nVp ipp x DC 0\nRp x ipn 1.2m\nRiq vcc gnd 1k\n* ratiometric: Vcc/2 + 185 mV/A at 5 V, kept inside the supply\nBs s gnd V=limit(V(vcc,gnd)/2+0.037*V(vcc,gnd)*I(Vp),0.1,V(vcc,gnd)-0.1)*step(V(vcc,gnd)-3,0.3)\n* FILTER pin: 1.7k with an external capacitor to ground makes a low-pass filter\nRf s filt 1.7k\nBo o gnd V=V(filt,gnd)\nRo o out 1\n.ends ACS712",
          "pins": [
            "1",
            "3",
            "5",
            "6",
            "7",
            "8"
          ],
          "params": {},
          "limits": [
            "出力は電流に比例(185mV/A、ゼロ電流で Vcc/2)で、電源電圧に比例します。オフセット誤差・温度ドリフト・ノイズ(21mV 程度)・帯域(80kHz)は扱いません。",
            "FILTER ピンと GND の間に外付けコンデンサ(コンデンサなしなら 80kHz 相当は再現しません)をつけると、1.7kΩとのローパスになります。",
            "ホール素子の絶縁(2.1kV)・過電流(±5A の定格)は扱いません。"
          ]
        },
        "ratings": {
          "v_max": 6.0,
          "i_max": 5.0,
          "rows": [
            {
              "name": "感度",
              "value": "185mV/A",
              "condition": "Vcc = 5V"
            },
            {
              "name": "導体抵抗",
              "value": "1.2mΩ"
            },
            {
              "name": "ゼロ電流出力",
              "value": "Vcc/2"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
